ler behoben, bei dem die Dauer eines Vortrags nicht auf unendlich gestellt werden konnte\n* Fehler behoben, bei dem Fokusthemen mit mehr als sechs Fragen nicht beendet werden konnten\n* Fehler behoben, bei dem Fokusthemen mit mehr als zehn Fragen vorzeitig abgebrochen sind", "created_date": 1779182871, "id": "26805046879116995", "version": "1.6.7.2", "version_code": 1060702, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5007872822594381", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27648341291454212"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1085418402318091"}]}, "change_log": "- Fixed AI connection getting closed before last audio evaluation was received\n- Fixed wrong notification message when using a different disturber list from what is selected in webspace\n- Fixed custom module time limit getting overwritten\n- Improved module time slider visuals", "created_date": 1773131549, "id": "26027436250211399", "version": "1.6.6.4", "version_code": 1060604, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5007872822594381", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27648341291454212"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1085418402318091"}]}, "change_log": "- fixed AI connection ge